    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Classes Won't Be Modernized - TechRadar Interview with Blizzard",
      "es": "WoW: Las clases para siempre no se modernizarán - Entrevista de TechRadar con Blizzard"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Classes Won't Be Modernized - TechRadar Interview with Blizzard...",
      "es": "WoW: Las clases para siempre no se modernizarán - Entrevista de TechRadar con Blizzard..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace14f1c64d75.11961345\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In an interview with TechRadar, Blizzard discusses WoW: Forever classes, modern WoW races, and Summoning Stones.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/wow-forevers-classes-wont-be-modernized-but-blizzard-has-added-some-new-mechanics-for-engaging-depth-as-some-classes-in-world-of-warcraft-classic-were-too-simple\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Interview Part 1</span></a><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/blizzard-explains-why-wow-forever-wont-have-summoning-stones-says-easy-quick-access-to-teleports-shrink-the-world-and-easily-erodes-its-core-design-pillars\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Interview Part 2</span></a><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/can-fans-expect-goblins-or-vulpera-in-wow-forever-blizzard-says-it-has-no-plans-to-add-modern-wow-races-to-the-game-our-main-focus-for-the-game-is-to-build-off-the-foundational-lore-of-warcraft\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Interview Part 3</span></a></div><br><br>TechRadar had an interview with Blizzard on WoW: Forever and released information across multiple articles. We've summarized some of the key points from their articles:<br><br><span class=\"large-text\">Class Design</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Blizzard is not looking to modernize WoW: Forever classes.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They don't want to overhaul the Classic classes that players are familiar with.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Classes should be simpler but have engaging depth.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They like the pacing and combat speed of original WoW</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They do not want cheap respecs. The price will climb quickly and reset once per week.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Encounter Design</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The encounter team played a lot of Classic dungeons and raid content to understand how it felt.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Classic encounters were very approachable.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They want to still be creative and surprise the player, but they want everyone to return to the core pillars.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Races</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">There are no plans to add Retail races to WoW: Forever.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They want to build the game off of the foundational lore.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Summoning Stones</span><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Quick access to teleports shrinks the World.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">It also intrudes on part of the class identity of Warlocks.</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>In an interview with TechRadar, Blizzard discusses WoW: Forever classes, modern WoW races, and Summoning Stones.<br /><br />Interview Part 1Interview Part 2Interview Part 3<br /><br />TechRadar had an interview with Blizzard on WoW: Forever and released information across multiple articles. We've summarized some of the key points from their articles:<br /><br />Class Design<br /><ul><li>Blizzard is not looking to modernize WoW: Forever classes.</li><li>They don't want to overhaul the Classic classes that players are familiar with.</li><li>Classes should be simpler but have engaging depth.</li><li>They like the pacing and combat speed of original WoW</li><li>They do not want cheap respecs. The price will climb quickly and reset once per week.</li></ul><br /><br />Encounter Design<br /><ul><li>The encounter team played a lot of Classic dungeons and raid content to understand how it felt.</li><li>Classic encounters were very approachable.</li><li>They want to still be creative and surprise the player, but they want everyone to return to the core pillars.</li></ul><br /><br />Races<br /><ul><li>There are no plans to add Retail races to WoW: Forever.</li><li>They want to build the game off of the foundational lore.</li></ul><br /><br />Summoning Stones<br />Quick access to teleports shrinks the World.<br />It also intrudes on part of the class identity of Warlocks.</noscript>            \n        ",
