    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace12fda427d4.98226829\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Patch 12.1.5 launches tomorrow and Blizzard has released a trailer for the patch!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/patch-12-1-5-overview-features-activities-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Patch 12.1.5 Overview</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8214194.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/phxy5Gat_Gs/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>This trailer covers some of the features of the Patch:<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Kith'ix Campaign</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">New Aqir Invasions</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinths - A Multi-Wing Delve Exploration</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Confront the New Nemesis Boss</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Unbinding of Kith'ix raid.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">... ending with a teaser of Xal'atath</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Patch 12.1.5 launches tomorrow and Blizzard has released a trailer for the patch!<br /><br />Patch 12.1.5 Overview<br /><br />This trailer covers some of the features of the Patch:<br /><br /><ul><li>The Kith'ix Campaign</li><li>New Aqir Invasions</li><li>Labyrinths - A Multi-Wing Delve Exploration</li><li>Confront the New Nemesis Boss</li><li>The Unbinding of Kith'ix raid.</li><li>... ending with a teaser of Xal'atath</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
