    "title": {
      "en": "WoW Forever &amp; Ever Video by Carbot Animations",
      "es": "Video de WoW Forever &amp; Ever de Carbot Animations"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "WoW Forever &amp; Ever Video by Carbot Animations...",
      "es": "Video de WoW Forever &amp; Ever de Carbot Animations..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ace13a29e7376.43300191\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Carbot Animations' newest video covers WoW: Forever and many of the additions that players are excited for!<br><br>Carbot Animations is a long-time YouTube channel specializing in comedic video game animations, which has covered many Blizzard games in the past. They had a long-running <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLUS45oS4_EQk\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">World of Warcraft series</a>, but started to cover many more games after their <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S5Hzh43k330\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">This is World of WarCraft video in 2021</a>. They've still done occasional WoW videos <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMrwHe-8UNQ\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">such as during Plunderstorm</a>, but with the release of WoW: Forever, they've returned with a hilarious video about WoW: Forever!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kslJtHL89G4/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>This video highlights the nostalgia of returning to World of Warcraft with many of WoW: Forever's improvements:<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The starting zone experience</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Skyborne opening experience</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Camping system</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The new lighting and fog effects</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Dalaran City</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The name bans</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">... and more!</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Carbot Animations' newest video covers WoW: Forever and many of the additions that players are excited for!<br /><br />Carbot Animations is a long-time YouTube channel specializing in comedic video game animations, which has covered many Blizzard games in the past. They had a long-running <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLUS45oS4_EQk\" rel=\"nofollow\">World of Warcraft series</a>, but started to cover many more games after their <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S5Hzh43k330\" rel=\"nofollow\">This is World of WarCraft video in 2021</a>. They've still done occasional WoW videos <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jMrwHe-8UNQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">such as during Plunderstorm</a>, but with the release of WoW: Forever, they've returned with a hilarious video about WoW: Forever!<br /><br />This video highlights the nostalgia of returning to World of Warcraft with many of WoW: Forever's improvements:<br /><ul><li>The starting zone experience</li><li>The Skyborne opening experience</li><li>The Camping system</li><li>The new lighting and fog effects</li><li>Dalaran City</li><li>The name bans</li><li>... and more!</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
